The amendments put forward by the rapporteur , Mr Sanz Fernández , on behalf of the Committee on Culture are very positive , and we believe that only if they are adopted will Raphael be able to assume its proper role as a genuine reference point for safeguarding and developing Europe 's cultural heritage . 
